<section class="container editorial-intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">OEM & private-label enquiries</p><h1>A clear brief.<br> A better starting point.</h1><p class="lead">Tell us what your brand needs from its instrument range. We’ll discuss the product, presentation and sourcing requirements with you.</p><a class="button" href="/request-quote?intent=oem">Start an OEM enquiry ↗</a></div><div class="brief-panel"><h2>Bring your project into focus.</h2><dl><div><dt>Product</dt><dd>Instrument names, references or specifications</dd></div><div><dt>Brand</dt><dd>Marking, logo and packaging requirements</dd></div><div><dt>Market</dt><dd>Destination and documentation needs</dd></div><div><dt>Volume</dt><dd>Estimated order and sample quantities</dd></div></dl></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2>What to discuss with our team.</h2><p class="section-intro">Every project needs a feasibility review. Services, minimum quantities, sample terms and lead times are confirmed individually.</p></div><div class="service-rows"><% for(const [title,copy] of [['Instrument specifications','Share the catalogue reference, dimensions and any required material or finish. Do not rely on appearance alone when matching an instrument.'],['Branding & laser marking','Describe your marking requirements, placement and artwork. Ask the team to confirm which options are available for the selected instruments.'],['Packaging requirements','Outline individual packaging, labelling and presentation needs for your destination market.'],['Samples & quantities','Include sample requirements, estimated initial quantities and anticipated repeat orders. Availability and commercial terms are confirmed during review.']]){ %><div><h3><%= title %></h3><p><%= copy %></p></div><% } %></div></div></section><%- include('partials/cta') %>
